## Dataset

The dataset used in this project is the
DataCo SMART Supply Chain Dataset.

**Source:** [Kaggle Dataset](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/shashwatwork/dataco-smart-supply-chain-for-big-data-analysis)

**Dataset Size:** 180,519 records and 53 columns.

Due to GitHub file size limitations, the original
dataset is not included in this repository.

Please download the dataset from the original source
to reproduce the analysis.
